desc: Swap the two columns
category: ex
par: 27
hint1: Filter through an external command
hint2: :%! pipes the buffer through a shell command — awk can reorder fields
solution: :%!awk '{print $2"   "$1}'<CR>
note: :%! pipes the whole buffer through awk, which prints field 2 then field 1, swapped.
--- START ---
Alice   100
Bob     200
Carol   300
Dave    400
Eve     500
--- GOAL ---
100   Alice
200   Bob
300   Carol
400   Dave
500   Eve
--- END ---
